From 2aa66afc510b32ce54d2ce9d0cf233524c0abe59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ghajarvpn Build <build@ghajarvpn.local>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 12:19:08 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] feat(checkout): safe wallet fallback when delivery fails
 after payment

Track the order stage with the invoice and, once the panel confirms a
paid invoice that keeps failing to deliver the service (at least two
checks or an explicit PROVISION_FAILED), request payment_fallback_wallet
exactly once. Server-confirmed credits clear the invoice durably; a
delivered service can never be refunded. The fallback request is
idempotent client- and panel-side.
---
